Subject: [PATCH] simple: configure IMX596 video timing and stock colour baseline

Refresh mode timing, set frame periods before stream-on, track delayed VBLANK,
and constrain exposure for fixed-rate recording. Use the AAC RAW10 black
pedestal and conservative CC13 matrices, with temporal AWB smoothing.
This baseline does not implement Qualcomm custom trigger 1001 or the
proprietary scene, denoise, lens shading and per-module calibration paths.
Drain pending metadata requests on stop and avoid requeueing buffers after
the software ISP has stopped, including high-rate recording EOS.
Preserve the sensor exposure product on restart and redistribute shutter
and analogue gain within the requested frame period to avoid noisy restarts.

